# Route: guide 8 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren (1211
# of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 25 to 28, 30
# quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ashenvale): Night Run -> Fallen Sky Lake -> Mystral Lake -> Night Run
# -> The Zoram Strand -> Mystral Lake -> The Zoram Strand -> Night Run ->
# Fallen Sky Lake -> Raynewood Retreat -> Night Run -> Fallen Sky Lake ->
# Night Run -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old Gods
# (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Amongst
# the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922).

